        google: { rating: 4, review_count: 50, maps_url: 'https://maps.google.com/?cid=4807855919563758862&g_mp=CiVnb29nbGUubWFwcy5wbGFjZXMudjEuUGxhY2VzLkdldFBsYWNlEAIYBCAA', reviews: [{author: 'John', rating: 5, text: 'Very Nice, Clean place with lots to choose from.. What I initially went in for, apparently isn’t even legal yet in MN 🤷‍♂️, but what she had in store was more than enough to keep me in supply, and on my way.  Very friendly, knowledgeable, and even gave me some free samples on my way out the door…a little bit of old fashioned, person to person, we appreciate your business, customer service was a ni', time: '3 months ago'}, {author: 'N L', rating: 1, text: 'Straight up scammed, AVOID! Walked in looking for an 8th, was directed to a recommended strain, price wasn\'t bad, felt good about everything except that I had to use their in store ATM because they don\'t accept cards.  Get home, check it out, CDB hemp flower..... I\'m not picky on THC percentage, but damn, if I walk into a dispensary, I do want THC not CBD, as anyone would.  Clearly they know they\'', time: '3 months ago'}, {author: 'Alix M', rating: 1, text: 'I walked in and asked if they carried THC products. She said yes, but little did I know everything was Delta 9 and hemp-derived. I spent $74 on stuff that I don\'t consider authentic. I feel like I was lied to, not a great business model. I definitely won\'t be going back, especially since they don\'t have a return policy.', time: '7 months ago'}, {author: 'Zachary Psick', rating: 5, text: 'Really friendly and accommodating. Perfect selection for me. The location was great and the price was right.', time: '3 months ago'}, {author: 'Karen Sharley', rating: 1, text: 'Im not only extremely disappointed I shopped there, but I wouldn’t recommend anyone else shop there either. I should’ve read the reviews because I had the same experience as others, but I saw a woman Owned business and got excited. It’s not just misleading, the woman who sold to me straight up lied. I asked for Cannabis flower she showed me to the case where they had their small selection of HEMP ', time: '8 months ago'}] }
