        google: { rating: 4.6, review_count: 1773, maps_url: 'https://maps.google.com/?cid=10091604970785504202&g_mp=CiVnb29nbGUubWFwcy5wbGFjZXMudjEuUGxhY2VzLkdldFBsYWNlEAIYBCAA', reviews: [{author: 'Mj Finest', rating: 5, text: 'Tammy was very knowledgeable and extremely helpful. She took the time to understand what I was looking for and guided me through the options with confidence and care. I was especially pleased with the wide variety of edibles available. Overall, it was a great experience, and I truly appreciated her excellent customer service.', time: '3 months ago'}, {author: 'Dmitriy Mendeleev', rating: 5, text: 'Best bud tenders in the twin cities. Love their selection, and pricing is on point. They were beyond helpful, quick and efficient. I walked out with exactly what i wanted.  Parking was super easy, with plenty of accessibility. Will be coming back regularly', time: '5 months ago'}, {author: 'Teresa Alfuth', rating: 5, text: 'Hey, far aside from the cute hair I had the best cashier Rin - and she knew everything I had to ask and I won an awesome sign too. (They have great products)!This place is so freaking awesome. Five star review!', time: '3 months ago'}, {author: 'Ren Olive', rating: 5, text: 'I came on their opening Friday and the staff managed the line so well! I now go out of my way to stop here when I’m visiting the cities. This dispensary has a welcoming vibe: clean, funky, and has good mood lighting and music. Sabby and Rin helped me out and were lovely folks who made me feel seen and welcomed. I didn’t feel dumb for asking questions. They also have a good rotating selection of ac', time: '3 months ago'}, {author: 'virginia Burton', rating: 5, text: 'I have a great experience every time I visit Rise. Yesterday was no exception. I was checking out and was helped by Victoria. Victoria offered me discounts I was eligible for but not aware of ultimately saving me dollars. I really appreciate the helpful staff and easy transactions at Rise.', time: '3 months ago'}] }
