        gradient: 'linear-gradient(135deg, #166534, #22c55e)',
        initial: 'IP',
        img: "https://images.weedmaps.com/dispensaries/000/362/874/avatar/1765913316-untitled_design__17_.png",
        google: { rating: 3.9, review_count: 794, maps_url: 'https://maps.google.com/?cid=14008776347581454884&g_mp=CiVnb29nbGUubWFwcy5wbGFjZXMudjEuUGxhY2VzLkdldFBsYWNlEAIYBCAA', reviews: [{author: 'Colin Erickson', rating: 4, text: 'They are slowly improving the keif coated pre rolls are pretty good by lakeside, have not tried the wax or edibles yet.  I did try a cart it was okay... the flower is hit or miss but they do get good flower in Lemon cherry Gelato,  and Gumbo! just have to know what you are looking for to be honest and keep up with what they have in stock.  Store is always clean staff are decent Brittany is by far ', time: '7 months ago'}, {author: 'Jay Swap', rating: 3, text: 'Ive been here 4 times so far. The carts, specifically grasslandz are really good! However I bought 2 grams of lakeside wax. This is how it came. I could barely get the container open cause the wax melted and seeped around the container. And also after scraping it to get it off wasnt proper weight. I lost product because of it. Definitely do not recommend buying wax from this place.', time: '5 months ago'}, {author: 'Leah', rating: 5, text: 'Such a clean business! They are super helpful with any questions you have and they help make decisions if you\'re lost. Just bought a vape battery and was i formed of a better battery that will last longer. No upsetting, it was the same price, just being helpful. Its almost 2 hours away from me, but I will def come back rather than go to the winona dispensary.', time: '5 months ago'}, {author: 'Jason Ohmann', rating: 5, text: 'Island Pezi Cannabis Dispensary is hands down one of the best dispensary experiences I’ve had. From the moment you walk in, the atmosphere feels welcoming, clean, and professional without being intimidating. The staff is incredibly knowledgeable and genuinely helpful—they take the time to answer questions, make recommendations, and ensure you leave with exactly what you’re looking for. The product', time: '3 months ago'}, {author: 'Emma Begalka', rating: 5, text: 'I have visited twice now from the cities area (just under an hour drive each way) and I absolutely will again. Feels just like dispensaries in other legal states. Prices are decent, selection is decent, the employees are knowledgeable and make it easy to find what you’re looking for. It seems like a lot of the negative reviews are from a couple years ago when supplies were very limited and the bus', time: 'a year ago'}] }
