        features: ["Large menu"],
        gradient: 'linear-gradient(135deg, #166534, #22c55e)',
        initial: 'G2',
        img: "https://images.weedmaps.com/dispensaries/000/406/140/avatar/1774891151-copy_of_go_green__4_-png.png",
        google: { rating: 4.9, review_count: 85, maps_url: 'https://maps.google.com/?cid=3226216604501574224&g_mp=CiVnb29nbGUubWFwcy5wbGFjZXMudjEuUGxhY2VzLkdldFBsYWNlEAIYBCAA', reviews: [{author: 'Guido T', rating: 5, text: 'I had a great experience at this dispensary this past weekend, and a big reason was Justin. I don’t have any real knowledge of this stuff and was half intimidated walking through the door. However, I was instantly put at ease, as not only is he knowledgeable about the products, but he took the time to explain different options without making me feel rushed or pressured. He definitely knows his stu', time: '3 months ago'}, {author: 'Ok2BHuman', rating: 5, text: 'My husband and I stopped in to check it out. The two consultants were so helpful and definitely informative and attentive to Calvin’s specific needs and concerns. They recommended a strain of flower for hubby called Grandfather OG. Calvin loved the high that was more mellow from it. This is our new one stop shop, now. We can’t recommend this dispensary enough. Thank you, Green 2 Go!!', time: '4 months ago'}, {author: 'Tony Chavis', rating: 5, text: 'Friendly staff and some of the best flower I\'ve had to date. I\'m a medicinal smoker and the Mr. Frosty got me with a single one hitter. This flower blows away the flower grown and sold by the medical industry here all day. The prices are boutique but you absolutely get what you pay for. The only downside is the messy parking. But you get what you get for space these days. Thank you Green2Go!', time: '3 months ago'}, {author: 'Jerry Royce', rating: 3, text: 'The most honest review you’ll hear, first off they staff is friendly , informative but lacks that depth of what their product is & where it’s comes from.  Local here -  The 1/8 of flower they sell by are very inconsistent & expensive 62$ in tax for sometimes less than 1/8 I’ve taken them home “small plastic containers” weighed the “1/8” came up over a time or 2 by .06g  & under a lot more under we', time: '4 months ago'}, {author: 'Jack Walsh', rating: 1, text: 'This is a hemp store. Not a dispensary. Which i could forgive if they were honest about it. You can get all these products at a gas station. Its like selling only 3.2 beer and calling it a liquor store.', time: '3 months ago'}] }
